event: node_complete
data: {"id": "efd6d89d335e4a10-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "efd6d89d335e4a10", "seq": 849, "ts_ms": 1788761901211, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 55.62, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.5, "layer_reasoning": "根据工具返回的集群摘要，当前存在 1 个处于 Pending 状态的异常 Pod 和潜在的探针失败问题（尽管摘要中状态计数可能未完全反映 Running 但 NotReady 的 Pod，但分析文本和事件日志明确指出了两个活跃异常）。\n\n1. **Scheduling Failure**: Pod `workload-68c557d875-bsq52` 在 `aiops-case-01` 命名空间下，状态为 Pending。事件显示 `FailedScheduling`，原因为 `didn't match node affinity/selector`。这是一个典型的调度约束不匹配问题，属于 `PendingUnschedulable` 类型。\n\n2. **Probe Health Check Failure**: Pod `prometheus-observability-prometheus-0` 在 `monitor` 命名空间下。虽然其容器可能处于 Running 状态，但事件日志显示大量的 `Unhealthy` 警告，原因是 Liveness 和 Readiness 探针超时（`context deadline exceeded`）。这导致 Pod 无法进入 Ready 状态，属于 `NotReadyProbeFailed` 类型。\n\n综上，集群当前有两个独立的异常组，整体状态为异常。", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"CURRENT_STATUS\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.5, \"reasoning\": \"根据工具返回的集群摘要，当前存在 1 个处于 Pending 状态的异常 Pod 和潜在的探针失败问题（尽管摘要中状态计数可能未完全反映 Running 但 NotReady 的 Pod，但分析文本和事件日志明确指出了两个活跃异常）。\\n\\n1. **Scheduling Failure**: Pod `workload-68c557d875-bsq52` 在 `aiops-case-01` 命名空间下，状态为 Pending。事件显示 `FailedScheduling`，原因为 `didn't match node affinity/selector`。这是一个典型的调度约束不匹配问题，属于 `PendingUnschedulable` 类型。\\n\\n2. **Probe Health Check Failure**: Pod `prometheus-observability-prometheus-0` 在 `monitor` 命名空间下。虽然其容器可能处于 Running 状态，但事件日志显示大量的 `Unhealthy` 警告，原因是 Liveness 和 Readiness 探针超时（`context deadline exceeded`）。这导致 Pod 无法进入 Ready 状态，属于 `NotReadyProbeFailed` 类型。\\n\\n综上，集群当前有两个独立的异常组，整体状态为异常。\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload-68c557d875-bsq52\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-01\", \"status\": \"Pending\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"Pending,Running(NotReady)\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"PendingUnschedulable,NotReadyProbeFailed\", \"status_category\": \"ABNORMAL\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"workload-68c557d875-bsq52\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-01\"}, {\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"prometheus-observability-prometheus-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"调度约束不匹配导致 Pod Pending\", \"probability\": \"High\", \"reason\": \"Pod `workload-68c557d875-bsq52` 事件明确显示 `FailedScheduling` 且原因是 `didn't match node affinity/selector`，表明调度器无法找到满足亲和性规则的节点。\"}, {\"scenario\": \"应用健康探针超时导致 Pod NotReady\", \"probability\": \"High\", \"reason\": \"Pod `prometheus-observability-prometheus-0` 存在大量的 `Liveness probe failed` 和 `Readiness probe failed` 事件，原因是 `context deadline exceeded`，表明健康检查接口响应过慢或无响应。\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"Pending\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"PendingUnschedulable\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-01\", \"name\": \"workload-68c557d875-bsq52\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"PendingUnschedulable 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-pending-unschedulable.md\"]}, {\"group_id\": \"g2\", \"status_keywords\": [\"Unknown\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ObservationUnavailable\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\", \"name\": \"prometheus-observability-prometheus-0\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"ObservationUnavailable 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-notready-probe-failed.md\"]}], \"issue_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"Pending\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"PendingUnschedulable\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-01\", \"name\": \"workload-68c557d875-bsq52\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenar